  "description": "Defines the OASISDNA class and all associated configuration objects that control every aspect of OASIS runtime behaviour: active provider list, Auto-FailOver and Auto-LoadBalancing rules, Auto-Replication and Auto-Sync settings, encryption levels, FAHRN routing, HolonicBraid mesh config, API keys, and more. OASIS_DNA.json is loaded at startup and can be hot-swapped at runtime. Part of the OASIS Omniverse at https://oasisomniverse.one",
