  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.DNA v2.0.4\n\nDefines the OASISDNA class and all associated configuration objects that control every aspect of OASIS runtime behaviour: active provider list, Auto-FailOver and Auto-LoadBalancing rules, Auto-Replication and Auto-Sync settings, encryption levels, FAHRN routing, HolonicBraid mesh config, API keys, and more. OASIS_DNA.json is loaded at startup and can be hot-swapped at runtime. Part of the OASIS Omniverse at https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.3\n- Initial validated package contents and metadata for this release line.\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/OASIS Architecture/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.DNA",
